            "review_text": "Wallie H\nNorth Holland Province, The Netherlands5 contributions\n0\nVery bad\nFeb 2020 • Couples\nThd pictures in the menu look really nice. But what you get is somerhing quite different. I ordered eggnoodles with mushrooms that contained a loot of soft tofu and ONE mushroom. My friend liked shrimps but got burned black remainers of what once were shrimps.\nComplaints were not understood (???) untill they brought in a lady that spoke English. After translating and discusion she suggested to pay 50 %. We aggreed, did so and left. And were followed by the man of the restaurant, who demanded more money.\nSo:DO NOT GO THERE\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 23, 2020",
