            "review_text": "johnda667\nLeopold, Australia343 contributions\n0\nReally good food and service\nAug 2019\nWe had planned on eating at the night market, but it was raining so headed back towards our hotel when we saw this little gem. A quick look on Tripadvisor we saw great review, as we checked out the menu, a couple who had just eaten walked out and said to us it was great and recommended some options to us.\nFood was great, the service was amazing the girls are so genuine. I watched an elderly gentleman struggle to get his backpack on. Our waitress went running to him and assisted him with a smile, it was so nice to see. The staff are so genuine. The next day we saw two of the girls in the mini mart and they both said hello and smiled.\nFood was delicious I had the roast pork with sticky rice and my husband had the grilled pork with noodles and rice paper (you make rolls). Both meals were great! Also very good value, I think they were both 80,000 or 85,000 each.\nRestaurant is also well air-conditioned and right near the Benh Thanh market.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 26, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
